of my flight suit. Son, I can't help being who I am, who I was. It's not who you are, Dad. I love

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:59.900
who you are. It's being son of who you are. Look, I can't be your kind of hero.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.010
who you can't be, but each man gets a chance

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.290
