00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:16.790
I know. That's your good luck charm.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.050
Yuri Gagarin gave you that.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.340
Oh, listen, you hang on to it, and you give it back to me tonight, okay?

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:59.050
At 26.14 on the flight clock, we begin the major experiment of this shuttle mission.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:05.180
John Crichton will pilot a craft of his own design in a dangerous attempt to use

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:10.220
